ALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":3204320082,"text":"だからこの「写真機」で、「色」が強烈な物を撮ってきてほしいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[414010116]},{"nodeId":414010116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":3031453226,"text":"撮れたら、写真を刷り出して私に渡してくれ。この「写真機」のどこに問題があるのか知りたいんだ…","nextNodeIds":[414010117]},{"nodeId":414010117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":148875146,"text":"もし分からなくても、それらの写真を持って仕入れ先に問い詰めるよ。撮った写真は証拠にもなるはずだからね。","nextNodeIds":[414010118,414010120]},{"nodeId":414010118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2098223290,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[414010119]},{"nodeId":414010119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":2731273522,"text":"じゃあ任せるよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":414010120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":245681434,"text":"「色」が強烈な物ってなに？","nextNodeIds":[414010121]},{"nodeId":414010121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":2993476818,"text":"うーん…例えば、色がはっきりとしている物かな…赤い絶雲の唐辛子とか青い霧氷花とか…","nextNodeIds":[414010122]},{"nodeId":414010122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":1435027274,"text":"撮れたら、写真を刷り出して渡してくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":414010112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1361018658,"text":"触ったことない…","nextNodeIds":[414010113]},{"nodeId":414010113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30044,"speakerName":"季同","textMapHash":2779217626,"text":"そうか…でも大丈夫、操作は簡単だから…少し手伝ってくれるかい？","nextNodeIds":[414010114]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4140101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHE